{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":62565,\"title\":\"My Love Story!!\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Takeo Goda is a giant guy with a giant heart. Too bad the girls don't want him! (They always go for his good-looking best friend, Makoto Sunakawa.) Used to being on the sidelines, Takeo simply stands tall and accepts his fate. But one day when he saves a girl named Rinko Yamato from a harasser on the train, his (love!) life suddenly takes an incredible turn! Takeo can hardly believe it when he crosses paths with Rinko again, and he finds himself falling in love with her... But with handsome Suna around, does Takeo even stand a chance?\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oKvrM8WVOGcSSwIKFfsAxIuk6Nx.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dQruznwYPKGmiHvR7DS8pikwSca.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":8.4,\"voteCount\":387,\"year\":2015,\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":1,\"totalEpisodes\":24,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"Nippon TV\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"JP\",\"name\":\"Japan\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2015-09-24\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1793493,\"name\":\"Nanako Shimazaki\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1324085,\"name\":\"Kotono Watanabe\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8DXeuvMfEjit2uP9UmmftEhFwPo.jpg\"},{\"id\":1494116,\"name\":\"Hideki Hosokawa\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1694242,\"name\":\"Makoto Fuchigami\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1652934,\"name\":\"Toru Takahashi\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1793521,\"name\":\"Norihiko Nagahama\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":137703,\"name\":\"Morio Asaka\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rJ0bls6YNx4ZPW8MtX8gUtkiXUv.jpg\"},{\"id\":1852478,\"name\":\"Tomonari Tanaka\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"